@startuml DEPLOY-MONO
!include ../_theme.puml
title 改造前：Docker Compose 单体部署图
left to right direction

actor "用户浏览器" as User
actor "主播推流端" as Anchor

node "单台 Docker 主机" as Host {
  node "frontend 容器" as Frontend {
    artifact "Vue 静态资源" as Vue
    component "Nginx 反向代理" as Nginx
  }
  node "backend 容器（单实例）" as Backend {
    component "Gin API / WebSocket" as Gin
    component "Schedule Worker" as Worker
  }
  node "srs 容器（单实例）" as SRS {
    component "RTMP / HLS" as Media
  }
  node "mysql 容器（单实例）" as MySQL {
    database "danmakustream" as DB
  }
  folder "宿主机卷" as Volume
}

User --> Nginx : HTTP / WebSocket / HLS
Anchor --> Media : RTMP
Nginx --> Gin : /api /ws /media
Nginx --> Media : /live/*.m3u8
Gin --> DB : GORM / MySQL
Worker --> DB
Gin --> Volume : 视频、封面、HLS 文件
Media --> Volume : HLS 分片

note bottom of Host
单机、单实例；应用、媒体和数据服务共享主机故障域。
end note
@enduml

